{
  "uid": "pedidos",
  "title": "Pedidos",
  "description": "Três perguntas em uma tela: o sistema está com erro, está lento, o dinheiro está entrando?",
  "tags": [
    "desafio",
    "observabilidade"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "O sistema está com erro? % de cobranças com falha e % de respostas HTTP 5xx, contra o limiar do alerta",
      "description": "Cobranças com falha técnica sobre o total de cobranças e respostas 5xx da API sobre o total de respostas, em janela de 5m. A linha tracejada é o limiar da regra FalhaEmCobrancas: 14,4 x o error budget de 0,1% = 1,44%.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(cobrancas_processadas_total{resultado=\"falha\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(cobrancas_processadas_total[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "cobranças com falha",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"api\", status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"api\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "respostas HTTP 5xx",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "vector(100 * 14.4 * 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "limiar do alerta (1,44%)",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "cobranças com falha"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "respostas HTTP 5xx"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "limiar do alerta (1,44%)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    8,
                    8
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "O sistema está lento? Latência das requisições HTTP da API (p50, p95 e p99)",
      "description": "Percentis calculados do histograma http_request_duration_seconds, sem /metrics e /health.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"api\", route!~\"/metrics|/health\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"api\", route!~\"/metrics|/health\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"api\", route!~\"/metrics|/health\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "O dinheiro está entrando? Pedidos confirmados contra cobranças aprovadas, por minuto",
      "description": "Em operação saudável as linhas de confirmados e de cobranças aprovadas andam juntas. Confirmados acima de aprovadas é pedido entregue sem dinheiro.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "60 * sum(rate(pedidos_criados_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "pedidos criados",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "60 * sum(rate(pedidos_confirmados_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "pedidos confirmados",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "60 * sum(rate(cobrancas_processadas_total{resultado=\"aprovada\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "cobranças aprovadas",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "60 * sum(rate(cobrancas_processadas_total{resultado=\"recusada\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "cobranças recusadas",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "60 * sum(rate(cobrancas_processadas_total{resultado=\"falha\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "cobranças com falha",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "pedidos criados"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "pedidos confirmados"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "cobranças aprovadas"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "cobranças recusadas"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "cobranças com falha"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "O dinheiro está entrando? Pedidos confirmados sem cobrança aprovada no intervalo selecionado",
      "description": "increase(pedidos_confirmados_total) menos increase(cobrancas_processadas_total{resultado=\"aprovada\"}) no intervalo do dashboard. É estimativa (o increase extrapola a janela); a contagem exata sai do log do worker.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "clamp_min(round(sum(increase(pedidos_confirmados_total[$__range])) - sum(increase(cobrancas_processadas_total{resultado=\"aprovada\"}[$__range]))), 0)",
          "legendFormat": "pedidos"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    }
  ]
}
